msgstr "OK"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Tühista"

msgid ""
"The zram device could not be created. This kernel probably does not support "
"zram."
msgstr "zram-seadet ei õnnestunud luua. See tuum ilmselt ei toeta zrami."

msgid "Please wait..."
msgstr "Palun oota..."

msgid "Could not start command."
msgstr "Käsku ei õnnestunud käivitada."

#, python-format
msgid "%s of %s written"
msgstr "Kirjutatud %s / %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Error code %d"
msgstr "Veakood %d"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "Viga"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sulge"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Valmis"

msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Tühistatud."

msgid "zram is loaded and ready to use."
msgstr "zram on laaditud ja kasutusvalmis."

msgid "zram is built into the kernel."
msgstr "zram on tuuma sisse ehitatud."

msgid "zram is available as a kernel module and is loaded when needed."
msgstr "zram on saadaval tuumamoodulina ja laaditakse vajadusel."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The kernel of this receiver (%s) was built without zram. A swap file on a "
"drive is the best solution here."
msgstr ""
"Selle vastuvõtja tuum (%s) on ehitatud ilma zramita. Parim lahendus on siin "
"saalefail andmekandjal."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The kernel supports zram as a module, but the module is not installed "
"(kernel %s)."
msgstr "Tuum toetab zrami moodulina, kuid moodul pole paigaldatud (tuum %s)."

#, python-format
msgid "No zram support was found in the kernel (%s)."
msgstr "Tuumast ei leitud zrami tuge (%s)."

msgid "available"
msgstr "saadaval"

msgid "module missing"
msgstr "moodul puudub"

msgid "not supported"
msgstr "pole toetatud"

msgid "System information"
msgstr "Süsteemi teave"

msgid "UP/DOWN  Details     EXIT  Back"
msgstr "ÜLES/ALLA  Üksikasjad     EXIT  Tagasi"

msgid "Receiver"
msgstr "Vastuvõtja"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "Tarkvarapilt"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "Tuum"

msgid ""
"The kernel decides which memory features are available. It is part of the "
"image and cannot be changed by a plugin."
msgstr ""
"Tuum määrab, millised mälufunktsioonid on saadaval. See on tarkvarapildi osa"
" ja plugin ei saa seda muuta."

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

#, python-format
msgid "%d times"
msgstr "%d korda"

#, python-format
msgid "last: %s, %s"
msgstr "viimati: %s, %s"

msgid "never"
msgstr "mitte kunagi"

msgid "Out of memory"
msgstr "Mälu otsas"

msgid ""
"How often RAM and swap were full and the kernel had to end a program "
"(counted since the plugin was installed). If it happens, a swap file - or a "
"bigger one - helps."
msgstr ""
"Kui tihti olid RAM ja saale täis ning kernel pidi programmi lõpetama (alates"
" plugina paigaldamisest). Kui see juhtub, aitab saalefail – või suurem."

msgid "Swap support"
msgstr "Saale tugi"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "jah"

msgid "no"
msgstr "ei"

msgid "Required for swap files, swap partitions and zram."
msgstr "Vajalik saalefailide, saalepartitsioonide ja zrami jaoks."

msgid ""
"zram compresses swapped out memory inside the RAM (about 2-3:1) - no drive "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"zram pakib väljasaalitud mälu otse RAM-is (umbes 2-3:1) - andmekandjat pole "
"vaja."

msgid "zram (compressed RAM)"
msgstr "zram (pakitud RAM)"

msgid "zram algorithms"
msgstr "zrami algoritmid"

msgid "known after loading"
msgstr "teada pärast laadimist"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithms offered by the kernel. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best."
msgstr ""
"Tuuma pakutavad pakkimisalgoritmid. lz4 on kiireim, zstd pakib kõige "
"paremini."

#, python-format
msgid "active (%s)"
msgstr "aktiivne (%s)"

msgid "available, inactive"
msgstr "saadaval, mitteaktiivne"

msgid "zswap"
msgstr "zswap"

msgid ""
"zswap is a compressed cache in front of a swap file. It is only shown here "
"for information."
msgstr ""
"zswap on pakitud vahemälu saalefaili ees. Siin on see näidatud ainult "
"teavitamiseks."

msgid "none (only internal flash)"
msgstr "puudub (ainult sisemine välkmälu)"

msgid "none"
msgstr "puudub"

msgid "Drives for swap files"
msgstr "Andmekandjad saalefailide jaoks"

msgid ""
"Drives with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) that can hold a swap "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Linuxi failisüsteemiga (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) andmekandjad, millele saab "
"saalefaili paigutada."

msgid "Kernel configuration"
msgstr "Tuuma konfiguratsioon"

msgid ""
"/proc/config.gz lets the plugin see exactly which features the kernel was "
"built with."
msgstr ""
"/proc/config.gz võimaldab pluginal täpselt näha, milliste funktsioonidega "
"tuum on ehitatud."

msgid "Swappiness"
msgstr "Swappiness"

msgid "Page size"
msgstr "Lehekülje suurus"

#, python-format
msgid "%d bytes"
msgstr "%d baiti"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager settings"
msgstr "Simple Swap Manageri seaded"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Salvesta"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Väljas"

msgid "Swap file at startup"
msgstr "Saalefail käivitamisel"

msgid ""
"This swap file is activated automatically every time the receiver starts. "
"The plugin waits up to three minutes for the storage device to be mounted."
msgstr ""
"See saalefail aktiveeritakse automaatselt igal vastuvõtja käivitamisel. "
"Plugin ootab kuni kolm minutit, et andmekandja haagitaks."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"How eagerly the kernel moves memory to swap (0-100). Lower values keep data "
"in RAM longer; 10-30 is a good choice for receivers. Current value: %d"
msgstr ""
"Kui meelsasti tuum mälu saalesse viib (0-100). Madalamad väärtused hoiavad "
"andmeid kauem RAM-is; vastuvõtjatele sobib hästi 10-30. Praegune väärtus: %d"

msgid ""
"Lower values also mean fewer writes, which spares SD cards and USB sticks."
msgstr ""
"Madalamad väärtused tähendavad ka vähem kirjutamist, mis säästab SD-kaarte "
"ja USB-pulki."

#, python-format
msgid "Automatic (%s)"
msgstr "Automaatne (%s)"

msgid "zram compression"
msgstr "zrami pakkimine"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithm for the compressed RAM swap. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best but needs more CPU. A change takes effect the next time zram"
" is set up."
msgstr ""
"Pakkimisalgoritm pakitud RAM-saale jaoks. lz4 on kiireim, zstd pakib kõige "
"paremini, kuid vajab rohkem protsessorit. Muudatus kehtib zrami järgmisel "
"seadistamisel."

msgid "zram at startup"
msgstr "zram käivitamisel"

#, python-format
msgid "Set up the compressed RAM swap (%s) every time the receiver starts."
msgstr "Seadista pakitud RAM-saale (%s) igal vastuvõtja käivitamisel."

msgid "On"
msgstr "Sees"

msgid "Show plugin in"
msgstr "Näita pluginat"

msgid ""
"Where Simple Swap Manager can be opened. A change takes effect after "
"restarting the GUI."
msgstr ""
"Kust saab Simple Swap Manageri avada. Muudatus kehtib pärast kasutajaliidese"
" taaskäivitust."

msgid ""
"Shows what this receiver supports: kernel, zram, zswap and drives. Press OK "
"to open."
msgstr ""
"Näitab, mida see vastuvõtja toetab: tuum, zram, zswap ja andmekandjad. "
"Avamiseks vajuta OK."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Ava"

msgid "Uninstall plugin..."
msgstr "Eemalda plugin..."

msgid ""
"Removes Simple Swap Manager from this receiver. You can choose whether the "
"swap space is kept or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Eemaldab Simple Swap Manageri sellest vastuvõtjast. Saad valida, kas "
"saaleala jäetakse alles või kustutatakse."

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Eemalda"

msgid "Uninstall Simple Swap Manager"
msgstr "Eemalda Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager will be removed from this receiver."
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager eemaldatakse sellest vastuvõtjast."

msgid "Compressed RAM (zram)"
msgstr "Pakitud RAM (zram)"

msgid "Keep swap space"
msgstr "Jäta saaleala alles"

msgid "Stays active until the next restart, then it is no longer used"
msgstr ""
"Jääb aktiivseks järgmise taaskäivituseni, seejärel seda enam ei kasutata"

msgid "Delete swap space"
msgstr "Kustuta saaleala"

msgid "Deactivate now and free the disk space"
msgstr "Lülita kohe välja ja vabasta kettaruum"

msgid "What should happen to the swap space?"
msgstr "Mida saalealaga teha?"

msgid "Not enough free memory"
msgstr "Pole piisavalt vaba mälu"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s are currently stored in this swap space, but there is not enough free RAM"
" to take it back. Close some plugins or restart the GUI first."
msgstr ""
"Selles saalealas on praegu %s andmeid, kuid nende tagasi võtmiseks pole "
"piisavalt vaba RAM-i. Sulge esmalt mõni plugin või taaskäivita "
"kasutajaliides."

msgid "Moving data back to RAM..."
msgstr "Andmete tagasi viimine RAM-i..."

msgid "Deleting swap file..."
msgstr "Saalefaili kustutamine..."

msgid "Removing plugin..."
msgstr "Plugina eemaldamine..."

msgid "Simple Swap Manager has been removed."
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager on eemaldatud."

msgid "Swap"
msgstr "Saale"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Kokku"

msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

msgid "Swap spaces"
msgstr "Saalealad"

msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"Press YELLOW to create a swap file."
msgstr ""
"Saaleala ei leitud.\n"
"Saalefaili loomiseks vajuta KOLLAST nuppu."

msgid "OK  Options     MENU  Settings     INFO  System info     EXIT  Close"
msgstr "OK  Valikud     MENU  Seaded     INFO  Süsteemi teave     EXIT  Sulge"

msgid "Create"
msgstr "Loo"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Seaded"

#, python-format
msgid "Out of memory %d times since start - INFO for details"
msgstr "Mälu sai otsa %d korda alates käivitusest – üksikasjad INFO-ga"

