msgid "%s of %s used"
msgstr "Kasutusel %s / %s"

msgid "not active"
msgstr "pole aktiivne"

#, python-format
msgid "Swappiness: %d"
msgstr "Swappiness: %d"

#, python-format
msgid "Startup: %s"
msgstr "Käivitamine: %s"

msgid "Startup: off"
msgstr "Käivitamine: väljas"

#, python-format
msgid "zram: %s"
msgstr "zram: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Swap in: %s/s, out: %s/s"
msgstr "Saale: sisse %s/s, välja %s/s"

#, python-format
msgid "Written since boot: %s"
msgstr "Kirjutatud käivitusest: %s"

msgid "Swap partition"
msgstr "Saalepartitsioon"

msgid "Swap file"
msgstr "Saalefail"

#, python-format
msgid "%s used"
msgstr "kasutusel %s"

msgid "ACTIVE"
msgstr "AKTIIVNE"

msgid "INACTIVE"
msgstr "MITTEAKTIIVNE"

msgid "STARTUP"
msgstr "KÄIVITUS"

msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"No external drive with a Linux file system (ext4, ...) is mounted - press YELLOW for compressed RAM (zram)."
msgstr ""
"Saaleala ei leitud.\n"
"Ühtegi Linuxi failisüsteemiga (ext4, ...) välist ketast pole ühendatud – vajuta KOLLAST pakitud RAM-i (zram) jaoks."

msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"No external drive with a Linux file system (ext4, ...) is mounted. Connect a USB drive or hard disk and mount it in the image's drive settings."
msgstr ""
"Saaleala ei leitud.\n"
"Ühtegi Linuxi failisüsteemiga (ext4, ...) välist ketast pole ühendatud. Ühenda USB-ketas või kõvaketas ja haagi see tarkvara kettaseadetes."

#, python-format
msgid "%s RAM"
msgstr "%s RAM"

#, python-format
msgid "ratio %.1f:1"
msgstr "suhe %.1f:1"

msgid "compressed swap in RAM"
msgstr "pakitud saale RAM-is"

msgid "Deactivate"
msgstr "Lülita välja"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Lülita sisse"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Kustuta"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Eemalda"

msgid "Stop using this swap space now"
msgstr "Lõpeta selle saaleala kasutamine"

msgid "Start using this swap space now"
msgstr "Alusta selle saaleala kasutamist"

msgid "Don't activate at startup"
msgstr "Ära aktiveeri käivitamisel"

msgid "Remove automatic activation"
msgstr "Eemalda automaatne aktiveerimine"

msgid "Activate at startup"
msgstr "Aktiveeri käivitamisel"

msgid "Set up the compressed RAM swap every time the receiver starts"
msgstr "Seadista pakitud RAM-saale igal vastuvõtja käivitamisel"

msgid "Deactivate zram and give the memory back"
msgstr "Lülita zram välja ja anna mälu tagasi"

msgid "Change size"
msgstr "Muuda suurust"

msgid "Set up zram again with a different size"
msgstr "Seadista zram uuesti teise suurusega"

msgid "Use this swap file every time the receiver starts"
msgstr "Kasuta seda saalefaili igal vastuvõtja käivitamisel"

msgid "Create the swap file again with a different size"
msgstr "Loo saalefail uuesti teise suurusega"

msgid "Remove the swap file and free the disk space"
msgstr "Eemalda saalefail ja vabasta kettaruum"

msgid "Create new swap file"
msgstr "Loo uus saalefail"

msgid "What this receiver supports"
msgstr "Mida see vastuvõtja toetab"

#, python-format
msgid "Size: %s"
msgstr "Suurus: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Stored: %s, compressed to %s (%s RAM in use)"
msgstr "Salvestatud: %s, pakitud %s-ni (%s RAM-i kasutusel)"

#, python-format
msgid "Algorithm: %s, priority %d"
msgstr "Algoritm: %s, prioriteet %d"

msgid "Status: inactive"
msgstr "Olek: mitteaktiivne"

#, python-format
msgid "Used: %s, priority %d"
msgstr "Kasutusel: %s, prioriteet %d"

msgid "Startup activation disabled"
msgstr "Aktiveerimine käivitamisel väljas"

msgid "Activated at every startup"
msgstr "Aktiveeritakse igal käivitamisel"

msgid "Activate swap"
msgstr "Lülita saale sisse"

msgid "Setting up compressed RAM swap..."
msgstr "Pakitud RAM-saale seadistamine..."

msgid "Swap activated"
msgstr "Saale sisse lülitatud"

msgid "Deactivate swap"
msgstr "Lülita saale välja"

msgid "Swap deactivated"
msgstr "Saale välja lülitatud"

msgid "The file is not a valid swap file."
msgstr "Fail pole kehtiv saalefail."

msgid "Activating swap..."
msgstr "Saale sisselülitamine..."

msgid "Delete swap file"
msgstr "Kustuta saalefail"

msgid "Swap file deleted"
msgstr "Saalefail kustutatud"

msgid "Delete swap file?"
msgstr "Kas kustutada saalefail?"

#, python-format
msgid "%s (%s) will be deactivated and deleted."
msgstr "%s (%s) lülitatakse välja ja kustutatakse."

msgid "Restart GUI?"
msgstr "Kas taaskäivitada kasutajaliides?"

msgid ""
"The plugin is unloaded completely after restarting the GUI. Restart now?"
msgstr ""
"Plugin eemaldatakse mälust täielikult alles pärast kasutajaliidese "
"taaskäivitust. Kas taaskäivitada kohe?"

msgid "Restart now"
msgstr "Taaskäivita kohe"

msgid "Later"
msgstr "Hiljem"

msgid "No suitable storage"
msgstr "Sobivat andmekandjat pole"

msgid ""
"No storage device with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) was found.\n"
"Swap files cannot be created on FAT, exFAT, NTFS or network drives."
msgstr ""
"Linuxi failisüsteemiga (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) andmekandjat ei leitud.\n"
"Saalefaile ei saa luua FAT-, exFAT-, NTFS- ega võrguketastele."

msgid "No drive needed  ·  fastest  ·  uses a little CPU"
msgstr "Andmekandjat pole vaja  ·  kiireim  ·  veidi protsessorikoormust"

msgid "FASTEST"
msgstr "KIIREIM"

msgid "Not available on this receiver - press OK for details"
msgstr "Pole sellel vastuvõtjal saadaval - OK: üksikasjad"

msgid "NOT SUPPORTED"
msgstr "POLE TOETATUD"

#, python-format
msgid "%s free"
msgstr "%s vaba"

msgid "NOT RECOMMENDED"
msgstr "POLE SOOVITATUD"

msgid "NOT IDEAL"
msgstr "POLE IDEAALNE"

msgid "RECOMMENDED"
msgstr "SOOVITATUD"

msgid "FULL"
msgstr "TÄIS"

msgid ""
"Where should the swap file be stored?\n"
"A hard disk or USB drive is best; internal flash wears out faster."
msgstr ""
"Kuhu saalefail salvestada?\n"
"Parim on kõvaketas või USB-ketas; sisemine välkmälu kulub kiiremini."

msgid ""
"Where should the swap space be created?\n"
"zram compresses memory inside the RAM; it can be combined with a swap file on a drive."
msgstr ""
"Kuhu saaleala luua?\n"
"zram pakib mälu RAM-i sees; seda saab kombineerida saalefailiga andmekandjal."

msgid "Create swap file  1/2"
msgstr "Saalefaili loomine  1/2"

msgid "zram not supported"
msgstr "zram pole toetatud"

msgid "Not enough space"
msgstr "Pole piisavalt ruumi"

#, python-format
msgid "There is not enough free space on %s."
msgstr "Asukohas %s pole piisavalt vaba ruumi."

msgid "Use internal flash?"
msgstr "Kas kasutada sisemist välkmälu?"

msgid ""
"Swapping to the internal flash memory causes many write cycles and may "
"shorten its life. A USB drive or hard disk is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Saalimine sisemisse välkmällu põhjustab palju kirjutustsükleid ja võib selle"
" eluiga lühendada. Soovitatav on USB-ketas või kõvaketas."

msgid ""
"The internal flash is soldered in and cannot be replaced like an SD card or "
"USB drive - if it wears out, the receiver itself is affected."
msgstr ""
"Sisemine välkmälu on kinni joodetud ega ole vahetatav nagu SD-kaart või USB-"
"ketas – kui see kulub, kannatab vastuvõtja ise."

msgid "Use internal flash anyway"
msgstr "Kasuta siiski välkmälu"

msgid "Use SD card?"
msgstr "Kas kasutada SD-kaarti?"

msgid ""
"Swapping writes to the card again and again, so SD cards wear out faster. A USB drive or hard disk is recommended.\n"
"If you use the card: a low swappiness (10-20) keeps the writes to a minimum."
msgstr ""
"Saalimisel kirjutatakse kaardile ikka ja jälle, seetõttu kuluvad SD-kaardid kiiremini. Soovitatav on USB-ketas või kõvaketas.\n"
"Kui kasutad kaarti: madal swappiness (10-20) hoiab kirjutamise minimaalsena."

msgid "Use SD card anyway"
msgstr "Kasuta siiski SD-kaarti"

msgid "Custom size..."
msgstr "Kohandatud suurus..."

#, python-format
msgid "Enter a size between %d and %d MB"
msgstr "Sisesta suurus vahemikus %d kuni %d MB"

#, python-format
msgid "New size for %s (currently %s):"
msgstr "Uus suurus failile %s (praegu %s):"

#, python-format
msgid "RAM: %s  ·  available: %s"
msgstr "RAM: %s  ·  saadaval: %s"

msgid "Create swap file  2/2"
msgstr "Saalefaili loomine  2/2"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Select the size of the swap file on %s.\n"
"RAM: %s  ·  free space: %s"
msgstr ""
"Vali saalefaili suurus asukohas %s.\n"
"RAM: %s  ·  vaba ruum: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Swap file size in MB (%d-%d)"
msgstr "Saalefaili suurus MB-des (%d-%d)"

msgid "Invalid size"
msgstr "Vigane suurus"

#, python-format
msgid "Please enter a size between %d and %d MB."
msgstr "Palun sisesta suurus vahemikus %d kuni %d MB."

msgid "File exists"
msgstr "Fail on olemas"

#, python-format
msgid "%s already exists and is not a swap file. Please remove it first."
msgstr "%s on juba olemas ega ole saalefail. Palun eemalda see esmalt."

msgid ""
"The existing swap file is in use and there is not enough free RAM to replace"
" it."
msgstr ""
"Olemasolev saalefail on kasutusel ja selle asendamiseks pole piisavalt vaba "
"RAM-i."

#, python-format
msgid "%s will be recreated with %s instead of %s."
msgstr "%s luuakse uuesti suurusega %s, mitte %s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A swap file of %s will be created at\n"
"%s\n"
"and activated at every startup."
msgstr ""
"Luuakse %s suurune saalefail asukohta\n"
"%s\n"
"ja see aktiveeritakse igal käivitamisel."

#, python-format
msgid "The existing swap file (%s) will be replaced."
msgstr "Olemasolev saalefail (%s) asendatakse."

#, python-format
msgid "This takes about %d seconds."
msgstr "See võtab umbes %d sekundit."

msgid "Create swap file?"
msgstr "Kas luua saalefail?"

msgid "Create swap file"
msgstr "Loo saalefail"

msgid "Deactivating old swap file..."
msgstr "Vana saalefaili väljalülitamine..."

msgid "Removing old swap file..."
msgstr "Vana saalefaili eemaldamine..."

msgid "Writing swap file..."
msgstr "Saalefaili kirjutamine..."

msgid "Formatting swap file..."
msgstr "Saalefaili vormindamine..."

msgid "Size changed"
msgstr "Suurus muudetud"

msgid "Swap file created and activated"
msgstr "Saalefail loodud ja sisse lülitatud"

#, python-format
msgid "Swappiness set to %d"
msgstr "Swappiness on nüüd %d"

msgid "Protect the SD card?"
msgstr "Kas säästa SD-kaarti?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The swappiness is %d. With 10, the receiver swaps out less often and writes "
"less to the card."
msgstr ""
"Swappiness on %d. Väärtusega 10 saalib vastuvõtja harvemini ja kirjutab "
"kaardile vähem."

msgid "Set swappiness to 10"
msgstr "Määra swappiness 10"

#, python-format
msgid "Keep %d"
msgstr "Jäta %d"

#, python-format
msgid "needs at most about %s RAM when full"
msgstr "täis olekus kasutab kõige rohkem umbes %s RAM-i"

msgid "Compressed RAM (zram)  2/2"
msgstr "Pakitud RAM (zram)  2/2"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Select the size of the compressed swap (RAM: %s).\n"
"The memory is only used when data is actually swapped out; about half the RAM is a good value."
msgstr ""
"Vali pakitud saale suurus (RAM: %s).\n"
"Mälu kasutatakse ainult siis, kui andmeid tegelikult välja saalitakse; umbes pool RAM-ist on hea väärtus."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A compressed RAM swap of %s will be set up (algorithm: %s) and activated at "
